{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_04_end","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_04","title":"燈塔入口","storyCode":"SN-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"186f2e57331e7efbc5cfaf785c1460cd2791dec7594dd4c18f4e0e48102d3a52","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呼哈——天都亮了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"幹員們的裝備損耗，真是比想像中嚴重得多......不過，從天災之下救出這麼多人，大家還真厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我也要打起精神。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭小姐，我來取工程部的訂單啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，格拉尼！稍等，我看看放在哪......不好意思，幾天沒收拾，有點亂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......這裡是不是比我上次來更接近一個卡西米爾式的工匠坊了......嗯？這是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"......小說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"《最後的騎士》！怎麼在這？難道是昨晚翻箱倒櫃的時候壓在圖紙下面了......我說怎麼找不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"《最後的騎士》？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐在我小時候送給我的，是我以前最喜歡的小說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西米爾的騎士小說啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可以借我看看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，施術單元的理論書原來被丟在這裡......不好意思格拉尼小姐，估計還要費點功夫，我一會自己送過去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我等你。這次回羅德島可以待不少時間呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我就在這裡看小說打發時間啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"實在抱歉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"《最後的騎士》。\n很浮誇的名字，也很常見。卡西米爾的小說裡也許有幾百個最後的騎士，幾百個最快的騎士，幾百個最強的騎士。\n但既然是耀騎士送給自己妹妹的小說，那總該有些特殊之處吧？\n格拉尼如是想著，翻開書頁，發現其中夾著一枚書籤。\n上面用歪歪扭扭的卡西米爾文字，謄抄著一句興許是來自書中的台詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"“如果覺得浪濤吵鬧，就去令大海平靜。”......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"傳說最後的騎士回到伊比利亞。他眼中的敵人全非活物，衝鋒的目標只有群巒、城市和波濤。\n傳說最後的騎士定居海岸，餐風露宿，日復一日，直到他忘記如何摘下頭盔。\n傳說最後的騎士與巨浪搏鬥直至消失。他的家人發現了他留在岸邊的遺物，帶回騎士之國，埋進深山。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"narration","text":"傳說他或她的故事被一位詩人知曉，加工，傳唱，賦予其表意與符號。以這種形式，騎士回到了騎士之國，飽受爭議......\n但是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......也有人相信，相信瘋癲的騎士戰勝了海、時間與死亡。他奔赴追逐，直到萬物終結。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......什麼東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"騎士沒有答話。他死死盯著歌蕾蒂婭。\n歌蕾蒂婭很快意識到，他並非盯著自己。\n他只是......盯著自己懷裡的，那把鑰匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......咳咳......嘶......"},{"type":"narration","text":"騎士張嘴，騎士要發出聲音。乾癟的聲響，像是肌肉撕裂。\n騎士開始向前邁步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你從哪裡拿到那把鑰匙的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，我無意......打探所謂羅德島的內部事務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那是布雷奧甘的遺產，經由那四匹巨獸的手，再交給了那個深海獵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"因為一些機緣巧合，方才深海獵人中的一位，在卡西米爾發現了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......卡西米爾？真是個遙遠的國度，我還記得年輕時跟隨導師接待騎士之國的來使，私下聽幾位手持銀槍的征戰騎士描述他們的理想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"據說那個國家變了許多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"無論這種變化的好壞優劣，這種發生在當下時代的每一個政治實體上的變化，卻與伊比利亞無緣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們就像落入陷阱的困獸，反抗掙扎，會痛，會流血。放棄，則死路一條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們揪出那些尚是人類的背叛者之前，凱爾希，我有了一個新的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會意識不到，那個少年絕非布雷奧甘的後裔。審判庭不可能漏過這樣重要的線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼還要讓他去白白送死？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼喚同伴的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......數量在增多。但是抵達燈塔之前，它們都沒有現身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長、長官！我找到打開大門的辦法了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是伊比利亞之眼核心建築是一座很高很高的塔！升降設施沒有啟動，我們只能——徒步！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（蠕動的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——長官！我們需要一些時間！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你帶那個阿戈爾人先走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"時間有限，艾麗妮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（激烈的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔，是她們？不，燈火在搖曳。有什麼踏入了我法術的領域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（萎縮的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"（這些東西害怕了。不，它們從未表露過恐懼。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"（是混亂？有什麼讓它們感到混亂......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（混亂的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"大審判官將提燈高高舉起，恐魚確實退回了礁石的陰影裡。\n等他再環顧四周，他卻發現，已被怪物鮮血染紅的礁石上，遍佈腐朽破碎的武器。\n審判庭的武器。如他的恩師卡門所說，審判庭並非沒有考慮過回收這座碩果僅存的燈塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"大靜謐並未波及這座燈塔，所以它得以保存完好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"但即使如此，審判庭從大靜謐之後，就從未真正取回過自己的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，本是高丘。城市一覽無遺，風光旖旎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞人駐守於此，日復一日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（警惕的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"而你們，卻將這裡，當做覓食的地點，還擅自建起巢穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"narration","text":"情緒。\n久違的情緒。\n從一名士兵到審判官，再到目窺真相。他經受錘煉，千百次的失去，千百次的重生，達里奧成為了伊比利亞為數不多的大審判官。\n審判官與大審判官，一字之差，天壤之別。\n他本以為自己將如鐵一般堅定下去，在一切伊比利亞的大敵面前，讓燈閃爍，令劍鋒利，使經卷的每一行字都踐行其意。\n但如今，他依然從胸腔中感到一種強有力的情緒。這股情緒並非完全來自律法與被鼓吹的正義。\n在承認其合理性後，大審判官達里奧，坦然接受了自己正感到悲憤的事實。他的手炮瞄準恐魚，他的目光放向海洋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你們死，則人類活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是我們的律法與經文，這是你們的，“弱肉強食”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g20_lighthouse_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然就和記錄裡的一樣，燈塔靠底部的能源供給，核心柱縱向分為數個區域，而這一層的控制台控制著——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......控制著什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃，信號記錄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們之後也會用得上的......但現在必須優先啟動整座燈塔的能源。繼續往上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願能在增援抵達前平安無事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？艾麗妮閣下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒什麼，是錯覺。有老師......有長官在外看守，應該不會出什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的......重啟燈塔的系統之後，也許升降設施也能利用起來，大家可以很快趕上我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們趕緊吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"他很古怪，他的身上還留著一些......氣味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼氣味？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"另一個陸地國家的氣味，你不會感興趣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毫無疑問，他是一隻海嗣。但是與昆圖斯不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可怎麼會有這麼多的陸地生物成為海嗣？他們不該頻繁接觸到海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無法交流，那麼就只能讓他的軀體失去機能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"他要發起攻擊了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"騎士憑空從原地消失——但以深海獵人的視覺，捕捉他並不困難。\n有此等速度，他卻沒有選擇進攻深海獵人，他高高躍起，向著巨大的燈塔咆哮嘶吼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊啊啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g20_lighthouse_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊啊——怎、怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別慌！繼續往上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完成我們的任務——點燃燈塔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這股震動，是牆體受到了攻擊？怎麼可能，這裡離地面已經有好幾十米了，難道恐魚還有大炮嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（難道......難道是巨型生物？可是除了剛才那一下，沒有更大的動靜......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（老師......！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"騎士仰頭望去，燈塔紋絲不動。\n他不滿地晃了晃扭曲的武器。這柄曾是偉大工匠造物的長槍，如今附滿了來自深海的味道。\n礙事的目標沒有出現，騎士雙膝微彎，打算再試一次。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你在做什麼？"},{"type":"narration","text":"]"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你輕蔑地挑釁著伊比利亞，踏足禁區，損害重要遺產。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你自己，你連生而為人的尊嚴都不剩下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......尊......嚴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你的發聲器官還能運作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不清晰的發音）......海......不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"擊碎......海浪。踩著白晝，斥責痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事物，不應，保持原樣。大樹，扎根於大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的姿勢，你的盔甲，你的矛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你是卡西米爾人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是......我是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"騎士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......蠕行的鋼鐵......海浪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"（提燈不起作用。沒有其他船隻登陸的痕跡。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"（螢光的溟痕繞過了他。恐魚慌亂的源頭恐怕也是他。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"（那麼......他是偽裝成人形的海嗣？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你想摧毀伊比利亞之眼？審判庭不許。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊，土地——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"現在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......晚安，騎士先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"其他兩人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們？她們......她們在與騎士先生的同伴交流。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"不遠處正發生戰鬥。看來是一次文明的交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒我什麼事嘛，我就過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......你似乎與鹽風城那時不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"也與你我在格蘭法洛相見時有所區別。你在時刻變化著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海水令人清醒。哪怕只是海風夾帶的些微氣息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......我想回到海的懷抱，卻被斯卡蒂制止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的小斯卡蒂，她在害怕什麼......害怕什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"眼下情形，我更需要歌蕾蒂婭的解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈爾語）騎士先生，好騎士先生，回到你酣眠的深淵去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈爾語）我們不是敵人。"},{"type":"narration","text":"騎士沒有理睬如歌唱一般低吟的勞倫緹娜。\n對於方才給予自己重擊的“敵人”，騎士只是微微歪頭打量，很快將目光放回了那座高聳入雲的燈塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，多麼悲哀。語言已無法傳入你的耳朵，就像陰雲蒙蔽了你的眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使瘋狂，你的意志也像發條一樣，控制你的肉體前進嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，風暴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們共舞一曲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g20_lighthouse_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了！主控面板！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情況怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不清楚，這比圖紙上畫的複雜多了，而、而且我從來沒實際操作過這些東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又來了......外面發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"興許我們還是低估了在這裡可能遭遇的危險。這樣下去，要撐到懲戒軍的技術人員抵達恐怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，就算援軍抵達，要在這樣的環境裡修繕燈塔付出的犧牲無異於在高速軍艦的火力網下修築陣地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......市民喬迪，你是伊比利亞的一員。現在，我不問你的出身，以及格蘭法洛過去的種種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須爭分奪秒。現在，立刻，就盡你所能地嘗試獲取伊比利亞之眼的所有資訊，我和老師會保護這座塔，我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的......日誌已經調取......面板還有反應，塔下的能源模組還能運作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......動作很快，值得誇獎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後呢？如果要重啟整座燈塔，我們要多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我盡力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......我知道外面的各位在與那些來自海洋的怪物戰鬥，但是我還是得說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要面板還有反應，重啟應該不困難，這些我都在父母留下的筆記裡讀到過......雖、雖然是第一次實操......只能賭一把！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這是需要時間的！我們得——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守住這裡，是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別往下看，你繼續。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
